# docs/28 §3.2: the plug-in hint, left alone: after 5 s the Mac takes the offline memos.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100 lang=zh
include home_mac.cpas
usb off
wait 1500
include memo.cpas
usb on
include work_mac.cpas
wait 300
shot hint  plugged in: 1 offline go to this Mac · Tab: no
pull
shot held  a pull during the 5 s gets nothing: still R1
wait 5200
shot gone  the hint is gone after 5 s: the hint bar is back
pull
press opt+m
press ,
shot taken  the work Mac took it: Settings → Storage says 1 kept
